{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の甘えん坊で寂しがり屋な高校1年の16歳中元日芽香です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16さい＼(^O^)／☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/13は16さいのお誕生日!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか(伊藤万理華chan)と同じ16さいやあっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元さんおめでとーう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で言っちゃう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/4597378/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっくすてぃーん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16さい。バイクが運転できます。結婚もできます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもしないけどね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去った15さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15さい。あっという間で、充実してて、楽しかった!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂、高校受験、卒業、そして上京。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな幸せな15さい、ひめたん以外に見つかると思いますかー(*^^*)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15さいはいろいろ悩みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏はオーディション受けるか勉強に専念するかとか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋はこのまま中途半端に通い続けてて本当にいいのかとか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬は...前のぶろぐに書いたことあると思います(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時は(こんなに辛い15さい、いないよ...。)って思ってたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は幸せです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり目の前の壁が分厚いからかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よじのぼってみてはじめて見えるのがいっぱいあるんかねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだよじのぼってる真っ最中だけどねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか成長した気がします(*^^*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったらるんるん(斎藤ちはるchan)に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「どこがや(∀)!」なんてつっこまれそうだけどねー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15さいがとっても素敵だったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16さいはもっと素敵な1年にしたいのよ(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも大好きなめんばーのみんなと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなふぁみりーさんに支えてもらいながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなことがんばります!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんに関わる全ての方＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんと一緒に喜んでくれたり悲しんでくれたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩んでる時は背中を押してくれたり、またそっとしておいてくれたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで平和に楽しく過ごしてこれたのはみなさんの存在あってのもの!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからはひめたんがあなたを幸せするぜ(`・ω・')!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...と言いたいところですが、まだまだ成長途中の16さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかあなたを幸せにする日まで気長に応援してあげて下さいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンジェラアキさんの「手紙〜拝啓15のあなたへ〜」がうたえなくなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スマイレージさんの「夢見る15歳」がうたえなくなりますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは16歳が主役のうたを探してみようかな☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/4597378/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめかの名前の由来ってなんですかーーっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/4597378/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香の名前の由来は?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/4597378/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香ってご両親がどういった思いがあったのかぁと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/4597378/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香と名付けたのは誰ですか?由来を教えて下さい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが生まれた日の病院の窓から見た景色"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎日　暖かいお日様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎芽　桜の花びらからのびる新芽"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎香　風に散る桜の花の香り"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のような女の子に育ちますようにという意味が込められているそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まま、ありがとーうっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/4597378/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ誕生日のひめたん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その日は誰と誕生日を過ごしますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーおめでとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは学校にも行くしめんばーにも会う予定。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互いにとって素敵な日になりますように☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ(衛藤美彩chan)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉(岩瀬佑美子chan)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バースデーコールありがとーう(*^^*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんねっ半分寝ぼけてたっちゃんと会話できてかしら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもねー、0:13分に!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかうたた寝してたのよ。で、起きたらいっぱいメール来てるのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で「なに何ー??」って思ったらお誕生日でした(//ω//)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うえい☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}